<title>USA: Central European Media invests in TV Wisla.</title>
<headline>Central European Media invests in TV Wisla.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central European Media Enterprises Ltd and its Polish partner ITI TV Holdings, the Polish media group, said Wednesday they made an initial investment through their company TVN, in 3 percent of the capital of TV Wisla.</p>
<p>Wisla broadcasts to about 7.8 million viewers in southern Poland, a statement from Central European Media said.</p>
<p>No one from Central European Media was available to say how much money 3 percent of TV Wisla represents.</p>
</text>
